    "title": "Fender Player II Stratocaster Electric Guitar",
    "description": "The Fender Player II Stratocaster builds on the classic Stratocaster formula, offering its unmistakable sound and feel with player-focused refinements. It features an alder body for balanced resonance, a Modern \"C\" maple neck with a satin urethane finish for smooth playability, and a 9.5\"-radius slab rosewood fingerboard with rolled edges. The guitar is equipped with three Player Series Alnico V single-coil pickups for iconic Strat chime and versatility, a 5-way blade switch, and a two-point synchronized tremolo with bent steel saddles for expressive vibrato. ClassicGear tuning machines and a synthetic bone nut ensure reliable tuning stability. This electric guitar is designed for confident, expressive playing, delivering the versatility, comfort, and unmistakable Fender character that inspires musicians.",
